        "url": "https://x.com/DonAlt/status/2093148392038043681",
        "id": "2093148392038043681",
        "text": ">Market pulls back to $76k\n>\"I just need a pullback to $74k so I can buy before it goes to $100k\"\n>Never hits, miss entry by a couple %\n\nI never understand why people that think the market will go up a lot always hope for deep pullbacks\n\nThe reason you think the market will go up is because it is strong, why are you then in turn hoping for it to show weakness before you buy it?\n\nInstead you should hope it locks people out by not giving pullbacks to bid, which in turn will provide buying pressure into much higher levels",
